Z||000009||86seyellow||06-10-2001||11:22 AM||||my 2.8 has always gone thru a quart of regualr 1o w 40 about every 400 miles, no leak and doesnot smoke but still goes thru it. I had a clogged caqt which is where the oil was going, so last oil change I put in penzoil 10w 40 synthetic and a bottle of ring seal. Well its been 700 miles and no more oil use. it sounds meaner runs harder and I am so HAPPPPPPPPPPPPPPY~<P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
